# Zscaler MCP Security

When Zscaler MCP is available, prefer it for security audits, policy review, and incident investigation.

## Defaults

- MCP runs **read-only** (`ZSCALER_MCP_WRITE_ENABLED=false`)
- Scoped services: `zia,zdx,easm,zid,zinsights`
- Credentials only in `%USERPROFILE%\.zscaler-mcp.env` — never in repo or extension bundle

## When to use

- Audit ZIA rules affecting Supabase, Stripe, Google OAuth, Netlify, Resend, AI providers
- EASM review for pastecraft.com attack surface
- ZDX health for website login, checkout, extension auth flows
- Z-Insights incident investigation

## Write operations

Never enable write tools autonomously. Require explicit user approval and `--write-tools` allowlist per change ticket.

## PasteCraft AI surfaces

Apply AI Guard / DLP thinking to: `ai-refactor`, `ai-image`, `ai-lab`, Cursor agent prompts. Block secrets and clip PII in outbound AI traffic.

